#: functions.php:404
msgid "How one item looks in a list, such as an archive, a Query Loop or a carousel. Edit a card and every list using it follows."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/card-article.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Article card"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/card-article.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "An article in a list: its image beside its categories, title, standfirst, date and authors, stacking when the card is narrow. Edit the template part in the Site Editor, or override parts/card-article.html in a child theme, and every place that uses it follows: archives, Query Loops and Galerio Carousels."
msgstr ""

#. translators: Before the author's name in a list of articles.
#: patterns/card-article.php:30
msgid "· by "
msgstr ""

#: patterns/card-collection.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Collection card"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/card-collection.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "The content of the Collection card template part: a collection as a slide like the front page carousel's, with its image filling the card and a caption box holding the title, dates, categories and a button. Edit the template part in the Site Editor, and every place that uses it follows: the collections archive, Query Loops and Galerio Carousels. Its height is 420px unless --galerio-collection-card-height says otherwise."
msgstr ""

#. translators: Button on a collection card. {collection} is the site's name for a collection, such as "exhibition".
#: patterns/card-collection.php:20
msgid "View {collection}"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/card-profile.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Profile card"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/card-profile.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "A profile in a list: its portrait, name and groups. Edit the template part in the Site Editor, or override parts/card-profile.html in a child theme, and every place that uses it follows: archives, Query Loops and Galerio Carousels."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/card-work.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Work card"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/card-work.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "A work in a list: its image beside its title, creator, year and mediums, stacking when the card is narrow. Edit the template part in the Site Editor, or override parts/card-work.html in a child theme, and every place that uses it follows: archives, Query Loops and Galerio Carousels."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/card.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Card"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/card.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "Any item in a list: its image and title. A list using this card shows each item with its own type's card instead (card-work, card-profile and so on) when there is one, so lists that mix types stay consistent. Edit the template part in the Site Editor, or override parts/card.html in a child theme, and every place that uses it follows: archives, Query Loops and Galerio Carousels."
msgstr ""

